    {
     "title": "看词尾猜词性",
     "points": [
      "-tion, -ment, -ness, -er/-or（人）多是名词：information, government, happiness, teacher",
      "-ful, -less, -al, -ive, -ous, -able 多是形容词：useful, national, active, famous",
      "-ly 多是副词：quickly, really（但 friendly, lovely 是形容词）",
      "-ize, -en, -fy 多是动词：realize, widen, simplify",
      "同一个词可以有几种词性：work（n. 工作 / v. 工作），play（v. 玩 / n. 戏剧），看它在句子里的位置判断。"
     ],
